  "description": "Determine if two strings s and t are isomorphic. Characters in s must be replaced to get t, with no two characters mapping to the same character.",
  "target": "true",
  "pseudocode": "1: mapS = {}, mapT = {}\n2: for i = 0 to s.length:\n3:   charS = s[i], charT = t[i]\n4:   if !mapS[charS] and !mapT[charT]:\n5:     mapS[charS] = charT, mapT[charT] = charS\n6:   else if mapS[charS] !== charT:\n7:     return false\n8: return true",
  "steps": [
